---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party / adapted code
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of the live-data behaviour (ID8 host lifecycle, OBD/TASU polling,
renderer screen wiring) were adapted from IterioDev Car Data
(https://github.com/IterioDev/car-apps) at the direction of the repository
owner for Kingkong Tuning. The visual design is Kingkong Tuning’s own
(black + gold + logo) and is not a copy of Car Data’s look.

MIT-licensed fragments originally from cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps
(trips, engine-group catalogs) remain under the MIT terms above; see NOTICE.md.
